<title>NEW ZEALAND: WestpacTrust cuts NZ mortgage rate to 9.4 pct.</title>
<headline>WestpacTrust cuts NZ mortgage rate to 9.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>WestpacTrust said on Friday it would cut its New Zealand variable home lending rate to 9.4 percent from 9.95 percent, effective immediately for new borrowers and from June 4 for existing borrowers.  </p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
